{'symbol': 'TXN', 'date': '2023-01-19 16:03:00', 'title': 'HAVIV ILAN TO BECOME NEXT PRESIDENT AND CEO OF TEXAS INSTRUMENTS ON APRIL 1', 'text': "DALLAS , JAN. 19, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TEXAS INSTRUMENTS INCORPORATED (TI) (NASDAQ: TXN) TODAY SAID THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS SELECTED HAVIV ILAN TO BECOME THE COMPANY'S NEXT PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER (CEO), EFFECTIVE APRIL 1. ILAN, A 24-YEAR VETERAN OF TI, SUCCEEDS CURRENT CEO AND PRESIDENT, RICH TEMPLETON, WHO WILL TRANSITION OUT OF THESE ROLES OVER THE NEXT TWO MONTHS BUT WILL REMAIN THE COMPANY'S CHAIRMAN."}